  "answer": {
    "text": "Read the numbers on the meter and submit them on the signed-in form you already use, or phone the published number. This article explains the next step. It does not submit the reading. Mereford Customer Service is fictional. This response has been written by an automated AI chatbot. It is not a member of staff. You can ask for a person. You can ask for a person on 01632 960040, which is an invented number and not a live service, or at the weekday counter from 09:00 to 16:00. You can ask for this information in another format. A person arranges that. This starter does not decide that a reasonable adjustment has been made. Ofgem's blog of 5 February 2026 says energy companies should be clear when they are using AI, make it easy to speak to a human, and offer a non-digital alternative. This draft includes those three. It does not decide that a supplier has met that expectation, and it has not checked the system for fairness.",
